    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structlibbirch_1_1Range" kindref="compound">Range</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A <ref refid="structlibbirch_1_1Range" kindref="compound">Range</ref> describes the active elements along one dimension of an array. It combines an <ref refid="structlibbirch_1_1Offset" kindref="compound">Offset</ref> and <ref refid="structlibbirch_1_1Length" kindref="compound">Length</ref>. Each of these may have either a static value (indicated by a template parameter giving that value) or a dynamic value (indicated by a template parameter of mutable_value and initial value given in the constructor). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
